n aria-label=\"Смени темата\" class=\"inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-muted-fg hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-moon h-4.5 w-4.5\"><path d=\"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z\"></path></svg></button><a class=\"hidden sm:block\" href=\"/login\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl font-semibold transition-all focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none active:scale-[0.98] border border-input bg-transparent hover:bg-muted h-9 px-3 text-sm\">Вход</button></a><button class=\"inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-muted lg:hidden\" aria-label=\"Меню\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-5 w-5\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><section class=\"relative isolate overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-900 to-emerald-950\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;/images/van-loading.webp&quot;); background-size: cover; background-position: center center;\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950/55 via-slate-950/25 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 -z-10 h-28 bg-gradient-to-t from-background to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"container py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"max-w-xl rounded-3xl bg-slate-950/55 p-6 ring-1 ring-white/10 backdrop-blur-md sm:p-8\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-white ring-1 ring-white/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-luggage h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M6 20a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h12a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2\"></path><path d=\"M8 18V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14\"></path><path d=\"M10 20h4\"></path><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> България → Англия</span></div><h1 class=\"font-display text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-white md:text-5xl\">Как да изпратиш багаж от България</h1><p class=\"mt-4 text-lg text-white/85\">Три лесни стъпки — през който и да е офис на Еконт, до нашия склад в Манчестър.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"container py-16 md:py-24 !py-14 md:!py-16\"><div class=\"grid items-start gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_1fr] lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"space-y-5\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-soft\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand font-display text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-fg shadow-soft\">1</span><h2 class=\"font-display text-lg font-extrabold text-foreground\">Изпрати през Еконт</h2></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-fg\">От който и да е офис на Еконт в България — до нашия адрес:</p><div class=\"mt-3 space-y-2 rounded-xl bg-muted/50 p-4 text-sm\"><p class=\"flex items-start gap-2 font-semibold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Еконт офис „Гоце Делчев — Панаирски ливади“</p><p class=\"text-muted-fg\">Получател: <span class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Богослав Хубенов</span></p><p class=\"text-muted-fg\">Телефон: <a href=\"tel:+359877665144\" class=\"font-semibold text-brand-700 hover:text-brand\">+359 877 665 144</a></p></div><a class=\"mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700 transition-colors hover:text-brand\" href=\"/bg-office\">Адресът в България <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-soft\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand font-display text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-fg shadow-soft\">2</span><h2 class=\"font-display text-lg font-extrabold text-foreground\">Надпиши багажа</h2></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-fg\">Върху всеки багаж задължително изпиши трите данни от етикета вдясно — така пратката се обработва веднага.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-soft\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand font-display text-lg font-extrabold text-brand-fg shadow-soft\">3</span><h2 class=\"font-display text-lg font-extrabold text-foreground\">Получи го в Англия</h2></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-fg\">Събираме пратките всеки вторник. Багажът пристига в офиса ни в Манчестър в петък от същата седмица — получаваш го в избрания от теб офис.</p><a class=\"mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700 transition-colors hover:text-brand\" href=\"/uk-offices\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-building2 h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M10 6h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 10h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 14h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 18h4\"></path></svg> Виж офисите в UK</a></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-24\"><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-md rotate-[-1.2deg] rounded-2xl border-2 border-dashed border-brand/50 bg-card p-6 shadow-lift sm:p-7\"><span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-3 h-3.5 w-3.5 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full border-2 border-border bg-background\"></span><p class=\"mt-2 text-center font-display text-sm font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-pen-line mr-1.5 inline h-4 w-4 -translate-y-px\"><path d=\"M12 20h9\"></path><path d=\"M16.376 3.622a1 1 0 0 1 3.002 3.002L7.368 18.635a2 2 0 0 1-.855.506l-2.872.838a.5.5 0 0 1-.62-.62l.838-2.872a2 2 0 0 1 .506-.854z\"></path></svg>Напиши върху всеки багаж</p><div class=\"mt-5 space-y-4\"><div class=\"border-b border-dashed border-border pb-3\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-fg\">1. В кой офис ще получиш пратката</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-display text-base font-extrabold text-foreground\">Манчестър / Бърнли / Честър</p></div><div class=\"border-b border-dashed border-border pb-3\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-fg\">2. Трите имена на получателя</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-display text-base font-extrabold text-foreground\">напр. Иван Петров Иванов</p></div><div class=\"border-b border-dashed border-border pb-3\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-fg\">3. Английски телефон за връзка</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-display text-base font-extrabold text-foreground\">напр. +44 7xxx xxx xxx</p></div></div><p class=\"mt-4 flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 p-3 text-xs font-medium text-amber-800 dark:bg-amber-400/10 dark:text-amber-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-px h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Без тези данни обработката и получаването се забавят.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-border bg-muted/40\"><div class=\"container py-12 md:py-14\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar-days h-6 w-6 text-brand\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path><path d=\"M8 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 18h.01\"></path></svg> График за транспортиране</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-muted-fg\">Всички пратки, изпратени чрез Еконт, се събират всеки вторник. Багажът пристига в офиса в Манчестър в петък от същата седмица.</p><div class=\"mx-auto mt-8 flex max-w-xl items-center gap-4 sm:gap-6\"><div class=\"shrink-0 text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 font-display text-xs font-extrabold text-brand-700\">ВТ</div><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-foreground\">Вторник</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-fg\">Еконт събира пратките</p></div><div class=\"relative h-7 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"absolute top-1/2 w-full -translate-y-1/2 border-t-2 border-dashed border-border\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 border-t-2 border-brand\" style=\"width: 0%;\"><span class=\"absolute -right-3.5 -top-3.5 flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand text-brand-fg shadow-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span></div></div><div class=\"shrink-0 text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 font-displ